{
	"title": "Suite arithmético-géométrique : solution constante et limite",
	"description": "uₙ₊₁ = a·uₙ + b : ℓ = aℓ + b donc ℓ = b/(1 − a) ; limite de (uₙ) selon a (pièges : b/(1 + a), b/a, limite 0 car aⁿ → 0, limite u₀)",
	"grades": ["T_SPE", "T_COMP"],
	"points": ["TCOMP-006", "TCOMP-008", "TCOMP-012", "TCOMP-013", "TSPE-111", "TSPE-115"],
	"theme": "Suites",
	"domain": "Suites arithmético-géométriques",
	"subdomain": "Solution constante et limite",
	"level": 2,
	"status": "draft",
	"delay": 60,
	"shared": {
		"cleanCoefficients": true,
		"blankDefaults": {
			"acceptDecimal": true
		}
